# ⛔ CLINIC EXPORTS ARE PHI. A file from /admin's Export Records holds patient
# names, notes and reflections, and it lands in whatever folder the browser
# downloads to -- which on 2026-09-16 was this one. Untracked is not enough: one
# `git add -A` would have committed a clinic's records to GitHub. The name is
# glowpt-<slug>-<date>.json, set in Admin.jsx.
glowpt-*-[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9].json
